WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-02 - Four at the Table
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: 1984: 1883 (The Rock Opera)

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Set the silver by the candlelight

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Six places laid for the winter night

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Though only two of us pour the tea

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
We keep the chairs for the family

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Alistair's cello leans by the wall

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Waiting for someone to answer the call

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:26.000
We will not hire a stranger's hand

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:33.000
To play the notes they couldn't understand

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Four at the table in the amber glow!

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:49.000
Two in the shadow of the world below!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Pick up the bow and strike the chord!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Every lost voice will be restored!

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Breathe through the wood of Gwen's old flute

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:18.000
Never let the memory go mute!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:55.000
My hands are bruised from the heavy strings

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:02.000
Learning the weight that the silence brings

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:09.000
Track by track on the spinning reel

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:16.000
Making the phantom orchestra real

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:23.000
If I play the drums and you play the reed

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:31.000
Then nobody left us, nobody's freed

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:12.000
Hear the six of us in the room!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:19.000
Singing defiance across the tomb!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:26.000
Not a single chair is empty tonight

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:34.000
Under the Victorian gaslamp light!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:17.000
Four at the table in the amber glow!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:24.000
Two in the shadow of the world below!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:31.000
Pick up the bow and strike the chord!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:38.000
Every lost voice will be restored!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:06:18.000
All six of us... still at the table...

